WEBVTT

NOTE
Guide narration timing (local Kokoro voice). Regenerate after the ElevenLabs take.

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.790
Every industrial site changes by the hour.

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.150
Contractors arrive.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.830
Equipment is isolated.

4
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.170
Work moves.

5
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.080
Insurance sets conditions under which risk is accepted.

6
00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.430
Good teams translate them into permits, briefings and checklists.

7
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.150
But no one can hold a moving site in their head.

8
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.290
On Roof 03, hot work begins.

9
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.730
The certificate and safeguards are in place.

10
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:24.080
Then a sprinkler zone goes offline.

11
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.880
Nothing looks different.

12
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:27.310
Work continues.

13
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.270
But the conditions have changed, and nobody sees it.

14
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.870
If something goes wrong, questions begin afterwards:

15
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.180
What was happening?

16
00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.770
Which condition applied?

17
00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.620
Can you prove what was true?

18
00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.350
Today, the gap is often discovered too late.

19
00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.710
What if the decision existed when the risk changed?

20
00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:49.710
<v Worker>I'm welding on Roof 03 until six.

21
00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:56.790
Priora connects the activity to the conditions that matter, verifies the certificate and safeguards, and creates the record while work happens.

22
00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.560
Prevention before the work.

23
00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:00.240
Proof as it happens.

24
00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.490
When the sprinkler goes offline again, Priora sees it immediately.

25
00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:12.540
Now the risk owner can change the activity, knowingly retain the exposure, or eventually ask selected carriers whether they will cover it.

26
00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.440
Most work remains ordinary.

27
00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.190
A few changes become explicit decisions.

28
00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.770
Record becomes trust.

29
00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:20.430
Trust enables decisions.

30
00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.140
Decisions can carry price.

31
00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:24.280
Price can connect to capacity.

32
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.580
Priora.

33
00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.700
Infrastructure for activity-level physical risk.
